pan></span></span><span class=\\&quot;doc-code-line\\&quot;><span class=\\&quot;doc-line-number\\&quot; hidden>2</span><span class=\\&quot;doc-code-source\\&quot;><span class=\\&quot;syn-yaml-key\\&quot;>year</span><span class=\\&quot;syn-punctuation\\&quot;>:</span> <span class=\\&quot;syn-number\\&quot;>1999</span></span></span><span class=\\&quot;doc-code-line\\&quot;><span class=\\&quot;doc-line-number\\&quot; hidden>3</span><span class=\\&quot;doc-code-source\\&quot;><span class=\\&quot;syn-punctuation\\&quot;>---</span></span></span>&quot;},{&quot;expression&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;prefix&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;suffix&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;template&quot;:&quot;---\\nyear: {{ year }}\\n{{ directors | wikilink | yaml_property:\\&quot;directors\\&quot; }}\\n---&quot;,&quot;rawOutput&quot;:&quot;---\\nyear: 1999\\ndirectors:\\n  - \\&quot;[[Lana Wachowski]]\\&quot;\\n  - \\&quot;[[Lilly Wachowski]]\\&quot;\\n---&quot;,&quot;output&quot;:&quot;<span class=\\&quot;doc-code-line\\&quot;><span class=\\&quot;doc-line-number\\&quot; hidden>1</span><span class=\\&quot;doc-code-source\\&quot;><span class=\\&quot;syn-punctuation\\&quot;>---</span></span></span><span class=\\&quot;doc-code-line\\&quot;><span class=\\&quot;doc-line-number\\&quot; hidden>2</span><span class=\\&quot;doc-code-source\\&quot;><span class=\\&quot;syn-yaml-key\\&quot;>year</span><span class=\\&quot;syn-punctuation\\&quot;>:</span> <span class=\\&quot;syn-number\\&quot;>1999</span></span></span><span class=\\&quot;doc-code-line\\&quot;><span class=\\&quot;doc-line-number\\&quot; hidden>3</span><span class=\\&quot;doc-code-source\\&quot;><span class=\\&quot;syn-yaml-key\\&quot;>directors</span><span class=\\&quot;syn-punctuation\\&quot;>:</span><span class=\\&quot;syn-string\\&quot;></span></span></span><span class=\\&quot;doc-code-line\\&quot;><span class=\\&quot;doc-line-number\\&quot; hidden>4</span><span class=\\&quot;doc-code-source\\&quot;>  <span class=\\&quot;syn-punctuation\\&quot;>-</span> <span class=\\&quot;syn-punctuation\\&quot;>&quot;</span><span class=\\&quot;syn-string\\&quot;>[[Lana Wachowski]]</span><span class=\\&quot;syn-punctuation\\&quot;>&quot;</span></span></span><span class=\\&quot;doc-code-line\\&quot;><span class=\\&quot;doc-line-number\\&quot; hidden>5</span><span class=\\&quot;doc-code-source\\&quot;>  <span class=\\&quot;syn-punctuation\\&quot;>-</span> <span class=\\&quot;syn-punctuation\\&quot;>&quot;</span><span class=\\&quot;syn-string\\&quot;>[[Lilly Wachowski]]</span><span class=\\&quot;syn-punctuation\\&quot;>&quot;</span></span></span><span class=\\&quot;doc-code-line\\&quot;><span class=\\&quot;doc-line-number\\&quot; hidden>6</span><span class=\\&quot;doc-code-source\\&quot;><span class=\\&quot;syn-punctuation\\&quot;>---</span></span></span>&quot;}]\"><header><p id=\"frontmatter-template-example-label\">Generate YAML frontmatter and use extended Markdown syntax for apps like Obsidian.</p></header><div><div><pre aria-label=\"Template\"><code data-demo-template=\"\"><span>---</span>\n<span>year</span><span>:</span> <span></span><span>{{</span> <span>year</span> <span>}}</span>\n<span>{{</span> <span>directors</span> <span>|</span> <span>wikilink</span> <span>|</span> <span>yaml_property</span><span>:</span><span>\"</span><span>directors</span><span>\"</span> <span>}}</span>\n<span>---</span></code></pre></div><div><p><span>Output</span><span></span></p><div><pre aria-label=\"Template output\"><code data-demo-output=\"\"><span><span><span>---</span></span></span><span><span><span>year</span><span>:</span> <span>1999</span></span></span><span><span><span>directors</span><span>:</span><span></span></span></span><span><span>  <span>-</span> <span>\"</span><span>[[Lana Wachowski]]</span><span>\"</span></span></span><span><span>  <span>-</span> <span>\"</span><span>[[Lilly Wachowski]]</span><span>\"</span></span></span><span><span><span>---</span></span></span></code></pre></div></div></div></section><div><section aria-labelledby=\"terminal-title\"><header><h2 id=\"terminal-title\">Knap in your terminal</h2></header><p>Generate Markdown from Knap templates. Read the <a href=\"/cli\">CLI guide</a> for options.</p><figure data-code-block=\"\"><span></span><pre><code data-language=\"shell\"><span><span><span>npx</span> <span>knap</span> render <span>template.md</span> --data <span>data.json</span> --output <span>note.md</span></span></span></code></pre></figure></section><section aria-labelledby=\"install-title\"><header><h2 id=\"install-title\">Knap in your app</h2></header><p>Add Knap templating to your app using the <a href=\"/api\">API</a>.</p><div id=\"install-npm\" data-install-panel=\"npm\"><figure data-code-block=\"\"><span></span><pre><code data-language=\"shell\"><span><span><span>npm</span> install knap</span></span></code></pre></figure></div></section></div><section aria-labelledby=\"explore-title\"><header><h2 id=\"explore-title\">Explore</h2></header><nav aria-label=\"Language guides\"><a data-guide=\"variables\" href=\"/variables\"><h3>Variables</h3><p>Insert values from your data into a template.</p></a><a data-guide=\"filters\" href=\"/filters\"><h3>Filters</h3><p>Transform values and format Markdown.</p></a><a data-guide=\"logic\" href=\"/logic\"><h3>Logic</h3><p>Include content conditionally and repeat it over arrays.</p></a></nav></section><section aria-labelledby=\"knap-in-use\"><header><P><h2 id=\"knap-in-use\">Knap in use</h2></P><p>Knap is <a href=\"https://github.com/obsidianmd/knap\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">open source</a>. It started as the templating language for <a href=\"https://obsidian.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Obsidian</a>. Now any tool can use it. Knap is named after <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Knapping\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">knapping</a>, the process of shaping stones to form arrowheads, scrapers, and other tools.</p></header></section></div></div></DIV>","content_tex