-code-line\\&quot;><span class=\\&quot;doc-line-number\\&quot; hidden>1</span><span class=\\&quot;doc-code-source\\&quot;><span class=\\&quot;syn-punctuation\\&quot;>---</span></span></span><span class=\\&quot;doc-code-line\\&quot;><span class=\\&quot;doc-line-number\\&quot; hidden>2</span><span class=\\&quot;doc-code-source\\&quot;><span class=\\&quot;syn-yaml-key\\&quot;>year</span><span class=\\&quot;syn-punctuation\\&quot;>:</span> <span class=\\&quot;syn-number\\&quot;>1999</span></span></span><span class=\\&quot;doc-code-line\\&quot;><span class=\\&quot;doc-line-number\\&quot; hidden>3</span><span class=\\&quot;doc-code-source\\&quot;><span class=\\&quot;syn-yaml-key\\&quot;>directors</span><span class=\\&quot;syn-punctuation\\&quot;>:</span><span class=\\&quot;syn-string\\&quot;></span></span></span><span class=\\&quot;doc-code-line\\&quot;><span class=\\&quot;doc-line-number\\&quot; hidden>4</span><span class=\\&quot;doc-code-source\\&quot;>  <span class=\\&quot;syn-punctuation\\&quot;>-</span> <span class=\\&quot;syn-punctuation\\&quot;>&quot;</span><span class=\\&quot;syn-string\\&quot;>[[Lana Wachowski]]</span><span class=\\&quot;syn-punctuation\\&quot;>&quot;</span></span></span><span class=\\&quot;doc-code-line\\&quot;><span class=\\&quot;doc-line-number\\&quot; hidden>5</span><span class=\\&quot;doc-code-source\\&quot;>  <span class=\\&quot;syn-punctuation\\&quot;>-</span> <span class=\\&quot;syn-punctuation\\&quot;>&quot;</span><span class=\\&quot;syn-string\\&quot;>[[Lilly Wachowski]]</span><span class=\\&quot;syn-punctuation\\&quot;>&quot;</span></span></span><span class=\\&quot;doc-code-line\\&quot;><span class=\\&quot;doc-line-number\\&quot; hidden>6</span><span class=\\&quot;doc-code-source\\&quot;><span class=\\&quot;syn-punctuation\\&quot;>---</span></span></span>&quot;}]\"><header><p id=\"frontmatter-template-example-label\">Generate YAML frontmatter and use extended Markdown syntax for apps like Obsidian.</p></header><div><div><pre aria-label=\"Template\"><code data-demo-template=\"\"><span>---</span>\n<span>year</span><span>:</span> <span></span><span>{{</span> <span>year</span> <span>}}</span>\n<span>{{</span> <span>directors</span> <span>|</span> <span>wikilink</span> <span>|</span> <span>yaml_property</span><span>:</span><span>\"</span><span>directors</span><span>\"</span> <span>}}</span>\n<span>---</span></code></pre></div><div><p>输出</p><div><pre aria-label=\"Template output\"><code data-demo-output=\"\"><span><span><span>---</span></span></span><span><span><span>year</span><span>:</span> <span>1999</span></span></span><span><span><span>directors</span><span>:</span><span></span></span></span><span><span>  <span>-</span> <span>\"</span><span>[[Lana Wachowski]]</span><span>\"</span></span></span><span><span>  <span>-</span> <span>\"</span><span>[[Lilly Wachowski]]</span><span>\"</span></span></span><span><span><span>---</span></span></span></code></pre></div></div></div></section><div><section aria-labelledby=\"terminal-title\"><header><h2 id=\"terminal-title\">Knap in your terminal</h2></header><p>Generate Markdown from Knap templates. Read the CLI guide for options.</p><figure data-code-block=\"\"><span></span><pre><code data-language=\"shell\"><span><span><span>npx</span> <span>knap</span> render <span>template.md</span> --data <span>data.json</span> --output <span>note.md</span></span></span></code></pre></figure></section><section aria-labelledby=\"install-title\"><header><h2 id=\"install-title\">Knap in your app</h2></header><p>Add Knap templating to your app using the API.</p><div id=\"install-npm\" data-install-panel=\"npm\"><figure data-code-block=\"\"><span></span><pre><code data-language=\"shell\"><span><span><span>npm</span> install knap</span></span></code></pre></figure></div></section></div><section aria-labelledby=\"explore-title\"><header><h2 id=\"explore-title\">探索</h2></header><nav aria-label=\"Language guides\"><a data-guide=\"variables\" href=\"/variables\"><h3>变量</h3><p>Insert values from your data into a template.</p></a><a data-guide=\"filters\" href=\"/filters\"><h3>过滤器</h3><p>Transform values and format Markdown.</p></a><a data-guide=\"logic\" href=\"/logic\"><h3>Logic</h3><p>Include content conditionally and repeat it over arrays.</p></a></nav></section><section aria-labelledby=\"knap-in-use\"><header><p></p><h2 id=\"knap-in-use\">Knap in use</h2><p></p><p>Knap is open source. It started as the templating language for Obsidian. Now any tool can use it. Knap is named after knapping, the process of shaping stones to form arrowheads, scrapers, and other tools.</p></header></section></div></div></div>"}